%% Search architecture
%% Two query paths (typeahead, full search) + indexer pipeline driven by CDC

flowchart LR
    subgraph Q [Query path]
        direction TB
        T[Typeahead<br/>per keystroke<br/>p99 < 50ms]
        S[Full search<br/>one query, ranked<br/>p99 < 200ms]
    end

    APIGW[API gateway]
    SRCH[Search service]
    REDIS[(Redis<br/>prefix cache + result cache)]
    OS[(OpenSearch cluster<br/>3 shards x 3 nodes<br/>~10M docs)]

    subgraph IDX [Indexing pipeline]
        direction TB
        PG[(Postgres catalog)]
        CDC[Debezium CDC]
        BUS{{Kafka: catalog.changes}}
        IW[Indexer worker<br/>bulk POST]
        CH[(ClickHouse: play_events)]
        AGG[Nightly popularity job]
    end

    T --> APIGW
    S --> APIGW
    APIGW --> SRCH

    SRCH -- prefix lookup --> REDIS
    SRCH -- on miss --> OS
    SRCH -- write through --> REDIS

    SRCH -- top-N + personalize re-rank --> SRCH
    SRCH -- in-app re-rank using user library / locale --> APIGW

    PG --> CDC --> BUS --> IW --> OS
    CH --> AGG -- bulk update popularity field --> OS
